    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young female vlogger embarks on a mission to hunt for ghosts. Her search turns out to be fruitful as she manages to encounter the paranormal. However, she now finds herself in a precarious situation, restrained and in need of figuring out how to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gameplay with a bound character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the challenge of controlling a heroine with her hands and feet tied together. Moving around will be demanding and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 levels with varied conditions and difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various trials such as having hands bound to feet, being suspended by the legs, or being blindfolded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple hairstyle and outfit options, with the ability to change colors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
